# INFO

## Metainfo file

Install this file as as /usr/share/metainfo/br.eng.camargo.newbase.demo.metainfo.xml

You can validate this metadata locally by running: appstreamcli validate br.eng.camargo.newbase.demo.metainfo.xml

## Desktop Entry File

Install this file as as /usr/share/applications/br.eng.camargo.newbase.demo.desktop

You can validate this metadata locally by running: desktop-file-validate br.eng.camargo.newbase.demo.desktop

## For more info

Esp. icons, check [here](https://docs.flatpak.org/en/latest/conventions.html#expected-standards).